# What a published extension contains.
#
# Written as "exclude everything, then name what ships" rather than a list of
# exclusions. A forgotten exclusion ships something by accident and a
# marketplace version can never be replaced, so the failure mode of the other
# direction is a missing file that shows up the first time the extension runs.

**

!out/extension.js
!syntaxes/**
!language-configuration.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE

# The bundle is what runs; its source map is 70 KB of no use to anyone who
# installed rather than cloned.
out/**/*.map
